<title>USA: Gottschalks June same-store sales up 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Gottschalks June same-store sales up 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gottschalks Inc said June 1997 sales were $38.4 million, up 2.7 percent over June 1996 sales of $37.4 million, and same-store sales were up 2.7 percent from last year as well.</p>
<p>On a year-to-date basis, comparable store sales were up 4.9 percent. For the first twenty-two weeks of 1997, total sales increased to $162.1 million from $154.3 million during the same period last year, it said.</p>
</text>
